    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Stack are delighted to present this charming 3-bedroom detached residence, ideally positioned on a mature and beautifully landscaped 0.51-acre site, complete with spacious outbuildings.\n\nNestled in a peaceful rural setting, the property enjoys the perfect balance of countryside tranquillity and convenience, located just a 6-8-minute drive from the heritage town of Listowel and its excellent range of amenities including schools, shops, the Greenway and town park.\n\nAccommodation comprises an entrance hallway, lounge/sitting room, kitchen/dining area, three spacious double bedrooms and a family bathroom.\n\nThe residence benefits from mains water supply, oil-fired central heating, on-site septic tank and double-glazed uPVC windows fitted throughout.\n\nExternally, the property truly shines. The south-west facing gardens feature mature lawns, established trees and colourful shrubbery, together with a raised seating area ideal for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing in the evening sun. A detached garage extending to approximately 50 sq.m offers excellent storage or workshop space, while the additional 8 sq.m outbuilding presents an ideal opportunity for a home office, studio or gym.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 3.38m x 1.80m\ntiled floor, glazed door & sidelight\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 3.94m x 3.58m\nwith cut stone and carved wood open fireplace and Dimplex electric heater and picture window\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.66m x 3.03m\ngloss fitted kitchen with integrated fridge and bins, induction hob, extractor fan and cooker, mosaic tiling, tile flooring, flue fitted to provide stove option, window and door to rear gardens and patio area\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.87m x 3.02m\ndouble with fitted units, wooden laminate flooring & window\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.83m x 2.60m\ndouble with fitted units, wooden laminate flooring & window\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.70m x 2.71m\ndouble with fitted units, wooden laminate flooring & window\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.98m x 1.76m\nlarge vanity unit with matching mirror, pumped rain shower, heated towel rail, wall & floor tiles, w/c & window\n\nOutbuildings - \n\n\nDetached Garage - 10m x 5m\nelectricity connected, plumbed for washer and dryer, glazed side door, double doors and additional door to side & 3 windows\n\nHome Office / Gym / Studio - 3.35m x 2.29m\nwith carpet flooring, electricity connected, 3 windows, door and glazed sidelight\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>3 bedroom, 1 bathroom detached residence</li><li>Set on a mature and beautifully landscaped 0.51-acre site </li><li>Spacious site with plenty of room to extend</li><li>Peaceful rural setting</li><li>6-8 minute drive from the heritage town of Listowel and all amenities</li><li>Mains water supply & onsite septic tank</li><li>Oil-fired central heating & double-glazed uPVC windows</li><li>High speed fibre broadband</li><li>Fully landscaped site with tarmacadam driveway</li><li>South-west facing gardens with mature lawns, trees and shrubbery</li><li>Raised seating area ideal for outdoor dining, entertaining</li><li>Sensor lighting </li><li>50sqm detached garage - ideal for storage / DIY </li><li>8sqm home office / gym space</li><li></li><li>Distances: </li><li>Listowel 6-8 mins</li><li>Ballybunion 20 mins</ul>"
      },
